sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Producer
    participant B as Broker TCP
    participant S as broker.json
    participant I as Inventory JVM
    participant E as inventory.json
    participant A as Audit JVM
    P->>B: PUBLISH (orderId, messageId, correlationId, schemaVersion)
    B->>B: Validate v1, check request identity
    B->>S: Atomic commit (request + recipient queues)
    B-->>P: PUBLISHED (accepted, not processed)
    par Inventory delivery
        B->>S: Persist in-flight attempt=1
        B->>I: DELIVER (same message and correlation ID)
        I->>E: Atomic effect + dedup commit
        I--xB: Process exits BEFORE ACK
        B->>S: Retry at front, attempt=2
        Note over I,E: Restart JVM, reload durable effects
        I->>B: SUBSCRIBE
        B-->>I: SUBSCRIBED
        B->>I: DELIVER same messageId
        I->>E: Existing effect -> DEDUP_SKIP
        I-->>B: ACK
        B->>S: Remove in-flight delivery
    and Audit delivery
        B->>A: DELIVER
        A->>A: Atomic durable audit + dedup
        A-->>B: ACK
        B->>S: Remove Audit in-flight delivery
    end
    P->>B: Repeat same request and destination
    B->>B: PUBLISH_DEDUP (no new delivery)
    B-->>P: PUBLISHED
    Note over B,S: Retry only if retryable; permanent failure or limit -> durable DLQ
